    "title": "Water Sort Puzzle - Color Sort",
    "description": "<b>Water Sort Puzzle</b> is a fun and challenging color water sort puzzle game! The water sort puzzle game sorts the colors of the water in the glass bottles into one color. When you play the water sort puzzle game, you are always using your brain, this is really addictive! \r\n\r\n<b>HOW TO PLAY</b>:\r\n\ud83e\uddea Tap the bottle to pick up.\r\n\ud83e\uddea Tap another bottle to pour the colored water.\r\n\ud83e\uddea We can only pour the water into the bottle with the same color of water on the top of the bottle.\r\n\ud83e\uddea You win when all the bottles with water only have one color, and all the bottles with water are full.\r\n\r\n<b>Water Sort Puzzle Games</b>: FEATURES\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Restart the game at anytime.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f You can use UNDO if you get stuck.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Thousands of water or liquid sort puzzle levels.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Exercise your brain with color sort games.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Easy play and addictive.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Play water sort puzzle games for free.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Add bottles for color sort at anytime if you like.\r\n\r\nWater Sort Puzzle Game is really a nice game, it makes you think with pleasure when playing, and it brings you good mood and sense of accomplishment. Water color sort puzzle game is also the best choice for you to train brain and relax your mind!\r\n\r\nDownload Water Sort Puzzle now!!",
